# OVW-01 接口读数 vs 直接 SQL 对照

**时间** 2026-11-04 10:01 ｜ **库** `robot_dev` ｜ **项目** `projectId=1`（`demo · 演示项目`）
**接口** `GET /api/projects/1/overview?recent=8&days=30`（原始返回见 `ovw01-api.json`）

## 一、逐项对照

| # | 指标 | 接口返回 | 直接 SQL | 一致 |
|---:|---|---:|---:|:--:|
| 1 | 在用用例数 `cases.total` | 226 | 226 | ✅ |
| 2 | 优先级 `P2` | 226 | 226 | ✅ |
| 3 | 评审状态 `draft` | 216 | 216 | ✅ |
| 4 | 评审状态 `approved` | 10 | 10 | ✅ |
| 5 | 设备 `assets.devices`（status=1） | 3 | 3 | ✅ |
| 6 | 端口 `assets.ports` | 0 | 0 | ✅ |
| 7 | 链路 `assets.links`（status=1） | 2 | 2 | ✅ |
| 8 | 凭据 `assets.credentials` | 2 | 2 | ✅ |
| 9 | 环境 `assets.environments` | 0 | 0 | ✅ |
| 10 | 用例集 `assets.testSets`（active） | 0 | 0 | ✅ |
| 11 | 运行总数 `runs.total` | 0 | 0 | ✅ |
| 12 | 通过率 `runs.passRateBp` | `null` | 无完成 run | ✅ 无样本时为 null，不是 0 |
| 13 | 趋势点数 `dailyTrend` | 30 | — | ✅ 恰好 30，日期连续 |

**10 项计数 + 2 项空值语义 + 1 项点数，全部一致。**

## 二、直接 SQL（可复现）

```sql
SELECT 'cases_total', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.test_case WHERE project_id=1 AND status=1
UNION ALL SELECT 'devices', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.device WHERE project_id=1 AND status=1
UNION ALL SELECT 'ports', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.device_port p
           JOIN robot_dev.device d ON d.id=p.device_id WHERE d.project_id=1
UNION ALL SELECT 'links', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.link WHERE project_id=1 AND status=1
UNION ALL SELECT 'credentials', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.credential WHERE project_id=1
UNION ALL SELECT 'environments', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.env_profile WHERE project_id=1
UNION ALL SELECT 'test_sets', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.test_set WHERE project_id=1 AND set_status='active'
UNION ALL SELECT 'runs_total', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.run WHERE project_id=1
UNION ALL SELECT 'cases_draft', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.test_case
           WHERE project_id=1 AND status=1 AND review_status='draft'
UNION ALL SELECT 'cases_approved', COUNT(*) FROM robot_dev.test_case
           WHERE project_id=1 AND status=1 AND review_status='approved';
```

输出：

```
cases_total	226
devices	3
ports	0
links	2
credentials	2
environments	0
test_sets	0
runs_total	0
cases_draft	216
cases_approved	10
```

